{"id":"623214","name":"午餐肉饭团","author":"Dinaking","authorId":"12567629","desc":"","cover":"images/623214/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"米饭","amount":"一碗"},{"name":"午餐肉","amount":"一罐"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"一个"}],"sub":[{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"一段"},{"name":"虾皮","amount":"适量"},{"name":"海苔","amount":"一张"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好所有食材。","img":"images/623214/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"午餐肉切片。","img":"images/623214/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"胡萝卜切成小丁。","img":"images/623214/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鸡蛋打散备用。","img":"images/623214/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅内加入适量食用油，加入鸡蛋翻炒。","img":"images/623214/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"炒好的鸡蛋先放一边，在家适量食用油加入胡萝卜丁和虾皮翻炒。","img":"images/623214/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入米饭翻炒均匀。","img":"images/623214/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"再加入一勺六月鲜轻盐酱油。","img":"images/623214/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"最后加入海苔碎。","img":"images/623214/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"翻炒均匀后就可以出锅了。","img":"images/623214/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"午餐肉罐头里放入一条保鲜袋，加入三勺米饭，用勺子压一压。","img":"images/623214/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"再加入一片午餐肉。","img":"images/623214/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"取出来后外面再包上一条海苔就可以了。","img":"images/623214/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"这样的饭团孩子可以吃点好几个呢。","img":"images/623214/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/623214/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}